# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 1: INTRO & OPENING PATH
# ==============================================================================
~ start
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Percival: *Draped in a billowing ruffled poet blouse, dark high-waisted trousers, and a black cape pinned by a glowing red gem brooch.*
Percival: *His void-black face splits into a terrifying vertical maw lined with sharp white fangs, while his black hands gesture poisedly with blood-red clawed fingertips.*
Percival: Ah... magnificent. Entrez, my delicate suitor.
Percival: Do not be nervous. I rarely bite on a first date... unless politely requested.

- "Your elegance and presence are breathtaking."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 8)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Percival: *Fangs click together inside his vertical maw as his red brooch glows brightly with romantic intensity.*
		Percival: Ah, a person of exquisite taste! You speak straight to my immortal soul...
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Gestures gracefully with his blood-red clawed fingers, tipping his head in a polite bow.*
		Percival: Ah, a person of refined taste! Finally, someone who appreciates true immortal poise.
	=> hub_part_1

- "I noticed your pale aesthetic and sub-normal warmth."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Percival: *Chuckles softly, swirling the vintage plasma in his glass with long crimson claws.*
	Percival: A keen observer! Sanguine body temperature rests comfortably at eighteen degrees. Cold flesh, warm heart.
	=> hub_part_1

- "Do you ever stop being so dramatically theatrical?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -10)
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Percival: *Fangs click together sharply inside his void-black face as his tone stiffens.*
	Percival: Hmph. Vulgar suitor. Dramatic flair is a high art form, not a performance for peasants.
	=> hub_part_1

- "Keep your distance. I don't trust blood-drinkers."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -20)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Percival: *His vertical gaping maw unhinges wider, white fangs glinting as his voice drops to an icy roar.*
		Percival: How dreadfully uncouth. Mind your tongue, suitor, or this evening will take a predatory turn.
		=> hub_part_1

# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 2: FIRST TOPIC LOOP (PART 1 - 4 TOPICS WITH FOLLOW-UP CHOICES)
# ==============================================================================
~ hub_part_1
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")

# Automatically progress to Phase 3 after completing all 4 Part 1 topics
if GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_a") and GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_b") and GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_c") and GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_d"):
	=> mid_date_interruption

Percival: So, my suitor... what secrets of the night shall we explore first?

- "What inspires your passion for gothic poetry?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_a")]
	=> p1_topic_a

- "What are your hopes after leaving Blackwood?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_b")]
	=> p1_topic_b

- "Do you ever enjoy quiet strolls at dawn?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_c")]
	=> p1_topic_c

- "Have you checked your reflection in the silver mirror?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_d")]
	=> p1_topic_d

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PART 1 TOPIC BRANCHES & INTERACTIVE FOLLOW-UPS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
~ p1_topic_a
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_a")
do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
Percival: Seventeen volumes composed over centuries in pitch-black gothic mausoleums!
Percival: Art is meant to disturb the comfortable and elevate the soul! Melancholy is the truest form of romantic passion.

- "I'd be honored to hear one of your sonnets."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 8)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Percival: *Gesturing with his crimson claws, the red glow inside his throat pulsing softly*
		Percival: 'O crimson night, thy velvet veil enfolds my lonely pulse...' Breathtaking, is it not?
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Recites dramatically with an open hand*
		Percival: 'O crimson night, thy velvet veil enfolds my lonely pulse...' Breathtaking, is it not?
	=> hub_part_1

- "Isn't writing about graves a bit depressing?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Percival: *Chuckles gracefully, white fangs clicking softly* Depressing? My dear suitor, dark beauty is the sweetest vintage!
	=> hub_part_1

~ p1_topic_b
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_b")
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Percival: I long to return to my ancestral manor and private library.
Percival: But above all... I seek a thoughtful companion who sees the gentle poet beneath the vampire.

- "I'd love to share quiet evenings in your library."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 8)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Percival: *Red gem brooch glows brightly, blood-red claws touching his ruffled blouse*
		Percival: Truly?! You speak straight to my ancient gothic heart...
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Smiles warmly* I shall reserve the wingback armchair right by the hearth for you!
	=> hub_part_1

- "You deserve a companion who understands your soul."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Percival: *Taps his crimson clawed fingers over his heart*
	Percival: Thank you. Your understanding warms my lonely pulse.
	=> hub_part_1

~ p1_topic_c
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_c")
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 50:
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Percival: *Adjusting his cape with a slight frown* We have only just met, suitor... Isn't it a bit early to be prying into my daily schedule? Let us get to know each other first.
	=> hub_part_1
else:
	You: Do you ever enjoy quiet strolls at dawn?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("vampire"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Smiles brightly, leaning forward with a relaxed posture.*
		Percival: Oh, I usually try to get an early start to my day right around 6 AM dawn before the asylum hallways get busy!
		do GameManager.record_clue("vampire", "vampire_sunlight_slip", "Casually mentions getting an early start to his day at dawn, oblivious to Vampirus Aristocratis solar necrosis and hardcoded nocturnal sleep lock.")

		- "Early dawn strolls sound very refreshing."
			do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
			Percival: *Smiles brightly* Indeed! Fresh dawn air is quite invigorating.
			=> hub_part_1

		- "Wait... you wake up at 6 AM dawn to stroll?"
			do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -10)
			do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
			Percival: *His fangs click sharply as he blinks, hurriedly adjusting his red brooch.*
			Percival: Well... I mean... of course I stay under heavy velvet curtains! I simply meant I rise early in spirit.
			Percival: Why are you scrutinizing my sleep schedule so closely, suitor?
			if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") <= 0:
				=> horror_exit
			=> hub_part_1
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
		Percival: Dawn?! My dear companion, I sleep strictly from sunrise to dusk in a velvet-lined coffin! Direct UV rays trigger immediate actinic photophobia and skin degradation.

		- "I'll make sure our dates take place strictly after dusk."
			do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 5)
			if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
				do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
				Percival: *Red brooch glows softly, touching his chest* How remarkably gentlemanly of you...
			else:
				do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
				Percival: *Smiles gratefully* That is most considerate of you!
			=> hub_part_1

		- "Is 6 AM dawn light really fatal to your skin?"
			do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -5)
			do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
			Percival: *Tilts his head slightly, looking a bit confused by your medical focus.*
			Percival: Indubitably... Though that is a rather morbid clinical detail to focus on during a date. Sunlight induces immediate UV degradation.
			=> hub_part_1

~ p1_topic_d
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_p1_topic_d")
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 50:
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
