# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 5: OUTRO & HORROR EXITS
# ==============================================================================
~ end_date
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
	do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
	Percival: *Gasps softly as the asylum bell tolls, placing his clawed hand over his heart with a romantic bow.*
	Percival: The bell tolls... Our velvet rendezvous must pause. Until next nightfall, my sweet suitor.
elif GameManager.get_affection("vampire") <= 35:
	do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
	Percival: *Adjusts his cape with a cold clink.*
	Percival: The bell tolls. Goodbye.
	Percival: *Turns away into the shadows.*
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Percival: *Gestures gracefully with his crimson claws in an elegant bow.*
	Percival: The bell tolls... Our rendezvous must pause. Until next nightfall, my date.

do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END

~ horror_exit
do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
Percival: *His vertical gaping maw unhinges completely with a terrifying roar! White fangs bare as shadows rise like shrieking bats!*
Percival: YOU DARE MOCK VAMPIRE NOBILITY?! YOUR BLOOD SHALL BE MY MIDNIGHT VINTAGE!
Percival: *He lunges forward with a bloodcurdling nocturnal roar!*
[SYSTEM]: *ALARM SIRENS BLARE* "CODE RED! DETECTIVE GET OUT NOW!"
[SYSTEM]: Guards drag you backward out of the cell as a heavy iron portcullis gate slams down with a deafening crash.
do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END
